SUMMARY:Spooky Scoot Tour with Strasburg Scooter Tours
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster County has long been known for its Amish farms and beautiful landscape\, but when the sun goes down\, the back roads take on a different look. \nFollow your guide deep into the night in one of our two-person Scoot Coupes as they lead you on a hair-raising adventure\, traveling along eerie back roads\, zipping past the pumpkin patch\, making stops to hear local folklore and the lesser-known haunted side of Lancaster County. One of the best immersive experiences other ghost tours can’t compete with. \nItinerary\nSome of our past tours have included: \n\nA guided tour of Lancaster County’s back roads\, after sundown\nFeaturing local folklore and stories of the eerie side of Lancaster\nWho knows\, there might be a surprise or two along the way.\n\nAnd each trip is unique\, so you never know what we might have in store for you! \nGuests must arrive 30 minutes before the scheduled start of the tour for a safety orientation. \nAnyone arriving late will forfeit the tour with no refund. \nEnjoy your spooky ride!
URL:https://lancasterpa.com/events-calendar/strasburg-scooter-tours-spooky-scoot-2/2026-10-10/
LOCATION:Strasburg Scooter Tours\, 246 N Decatur Street\, Strasburg\, 17579\, United States
CATEGORIES:Halloween,Outdoor Activities,Strasburg, PA
