SUMMARY:Blues\, Brews\, and "Boos"
DESCRIPTION:Open Air Music Festival on Front Street in Marietta!\nMusic\, Food Trucks\, Artisans\, Costume Contest. \nMusical acts are to be announced and will be on 4 stages from 1 to 6 pm. \nFREE admittance. \nIf your 21 and over STOP FIRST at one of our 3 EVENT TENTS for your $5 ID Pre-Check and Wristband. Both are REQUIRED to purchase cold adult beverages. The wristband also allows you to drink on the street and unlock discounted $5 selected drafts and cocktails. Proceeds support Front Street Cherry Tree Restoration & Monarch Habitat. \nParking is on-street for the event. There are many main streets and side streets to choose from with a short/safe walk to the event. Please park with care and only on the main streets\, not alleyways.
