SUMMARY:Harvest Days at Landis Valley Museum
DESCRIPTION:Harvest Days returns to Landis Valley Village & Farm Museum on October 10–11\, 2026\, inviting families\, history enthusiasts\, and fall lovers to celebrate one of Lancaster County’s original autumn traditions. \nExplore the sights\, sounds\, and traditions of Pennsylvania German culture through hands-on activities\, historic demonstrations\, traditional crafts\, live music\, and seasonal foods. Across the museum’s historic grounds\, visitors can discover the agricultural practices\, foodways\, and craftsmanship that connect today’s visitors to rural life in the 1800s and early 1900s. \nWhether you’re returning for a family tradition or experiencing Harvest Days for the first time\, there’s something to discover throughout the weekend.
URL:https://lancasterpa.com/events-calendar/harvest-days-landis-valley-museum/
