SUMMARY:Superhero Day at Strasburg Rail Road
DESCRIPTION:Superheroes Assemble! Join us October 10 at the Strasburg Rail Road\, America’s longest running short line rail road\, for Superhero Day. Back by popular demand\, we are once again partnering with Enchanted Teapot to introduce you to several of your favorite world saving friends! Make the most of your family’s experience by customizing your day from the following options: \n\n\n\nBrunch + Coach Guest: Brunch 9:45am – 10:15am in Cafe’ 1832\n\n10:15am – 10:45am: Meet & Greet- Join the Heroes in Lefever Hall for a photo opportunity.\n11am Coach ride- Ride along with some of the characters and have more photos taken during the train ride.\n\n\n11am Coach Ride Guest: Arrive 45 mins early to check in at the station.\n\n10:15am – 10:45am: Meet & Greet- Join the Heroes in Lefever Hall for a photo opportunity.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n11am Dining Car Guest: Arrive 45 mins early to check in at the station.\n\n10:15am – 10:45am: Meet & Greet- Join the Heroes in Lefever Hall for a photo opportunity.\nEnjoy a 45 min train ride with our invited Heroes as you enjoy your meal aboard the train. There will be story time and a sing along with the character throughout the ride. As well as some onboard photos.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n12pm Coach Ride Guest: Arrive at least 15 minutes before departure to check-in. Enjoy a 45 min train ride with our invited Heros\n\n12:45pm – 1:30pm:  Meet & Greet- Join the Heroes in Lefever Hall for a photo opportunity.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n12pm Dining Car Guest:  Arrive at least 15 minutes before departure to check-in. Enjoy a 45 min train ride with our invited Heros.\n\n12:45pm – 1:30pm:  Meet & Greet- Join the Heroes in Lefever Hall for a photo opportunity.\n\n\n\n\n\n\nBook your tickets now before they sell out!!
URL:https://lancasterpa.com/events-calendar/superhero-day-strasburg-rail-road/
LOCATION:Strasburg Rail Road\, 301 Gap Road\, Ronks\, PA\, 17572\, United States
