SUMMARY:Pumpkin Fest in East Petersburg
DESCRIPTION:East Petersburg is preparing for our Free Annual Pumpkin Festival on Saturday\, October 10\, 2026. This free and family-friendly Pumpkin Festival will be taking place from 10:00 a.m. to 1:00 p.m.\, in the East Petersburg Community Building. \n​The first 250 kids in attendance will receive free pumpkins to decorate in the East Petersburg Community Center! \n​Also\, Simply Greek at Roots Market is supporting East Pete Events with a fundraiser. For more details visit our Community Fundraiser page. \n​Food Trucks: \n​– Scoops\n– Todays Grind Coffee \n​Our Pumpkin Festival is made possible and free\, through the sponsorship of Charles Family Farm\, Lancaster Toyota\, S. Clyde Weaver\, Dinse Dental Care\, Lancaster Toyota\, and many others.
